            "review_text": "mandy6494\nAsbury Park, New Jersey61 contributions\n1\nThe BEST Crab Fried Rice\nFeb 2023\nThe little gem was right across the street from our hotel, Liberty Central Saigon City Center. It is a bar/restaurant and is open very late for travelers with jet lag. Very friendly english speaking severs. We went for a night cap every night we were there. The food is also excellent, the crab fried rice was one of my favorite dishes of the trip.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten March 15, 2023",
